<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="cd87a744">&lt;p&gt;
    These criteria are used to verify logistics to deliver training are complete.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Finalize venue
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Invite participants and confirm attendance
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Verify training venue has adequate facilities including necessary A/V or IT equipment
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
